/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 110 0 R
/E (The EduFinance platform emerges as an integrated solution that combines financial education and cutting-edge technology to democratize access to the capital market. The ecosystem was designed to transform the user journey, from organizing personal finances to executing complex investments, using the security of blockchain technology to guarantee the integrity of operations and portfolio simulations.)
